# Claude Code MCP servers — Mac-only (loaded in addition to mcp-servers.list)
# Format identical to mcp-servers.list. Only processed on Darwin hosts.

# Apple MCP — AppleScript bridge to native macOS PIM apps
# (Messages, Notes, Contacts, Mail, Reminders, Calendar, Maps).
# Requires `bun` on PATH (brew install oven-sh/bun/bun).
apple-mcp | bunx | -y | @dhravya/apple-mcp@latest

# Headroom — compresses large MCP tool outputs to save context window tokens.
# Binary installed via: cargo install headroom-mcp (or brew if available)
headroom | headroom | mcp | serve

# Dockhand moved to mcp-servers.infra.list — add "infra" to DOTFILES_WORKFLOWS to load.
